     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p/><text:p>              W<text:span text:style-name="T6">here boost ‘button glyph’ is an icon corresponding to the correct controller button.</text:span></text:p><text:p/><text:p/><text:p/><text:p/><text:p/><text:p/><text:p>            </text:p><text:p/><text:p>              Where ‘continue’ is inserted as the textToInsert parameter in functions like SetLocalizationOnText.</text:p><text:p/><text:p/><text:p/><text:p/><text:p/><text:p/><text:p>            </text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
